# The deepest nesting through an item's Parts tab: the location tree, the
# contents of Box B2 with everything below it, item 2 there in its form,
# its Parts tab, the item pick list of Ins for "Deep" and the help over
# that.  Each list on the way is paged to its end and back first (End,
# Home), so that it holds its ring of page cursors.
#@ DEEP
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END HOME DOWN DOWN ENTER END HOME ENTER ALT-C P END HOME INS
T Deep
K ENTER END HOME
S DEEPITEM
K F1
S DEEPIHLP
K ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
